BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Men's Event with Suvajra
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260816T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260816T130000
UID:f79adb5a1500695d7c97ff3e@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:LBC men's events focus on the most crucial aspects of spiritua
 l life with the hope of shining a light on the difficult and thorny questi
 ons that affect our spiritual practice. We look to get the most experience
 d Dharma teachers to address fundamental questions of what it means to pra
 ctise. These events include meditation\, discussion and ritual. Not to be 
 missed!
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/mens-event-with-suvajra
END:VEVENT
